Choose LF instead of an outnumbered CR in a mixed-newline Notepad file.
At 4fbbefd614b three LFs and one CR select CR before the LF count is
considered. Before 0a851eadcb7 the largest count won. Restore strict
pluralities; retain the current tie behavior and output encodings.
